OL,3,GNEWSABarlinnie prison has had
OL,4,A'significant' issues with water supply
OL,5,Afor six years
OL,6,
OL,7,FScotland's biggest prison has had
OL,8,F"significant" issues with its water
OL,9,Fsupply for at least six years, it has
OL,10,Fbeen revealed.
OL,12,FMore than five million litres of water
OL,13,Fwere lost during an incident last month
OL,14,Fat HMP Barlinnie in Glasgow which left
OL,15,Fsome prisoners without running water in
OL,16,Ftheir cells, the Scottish Prison
OL,17,FService (SPS) said.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
