OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,.*,%-. * *,$%** %-& (,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABarlinnie prison has had
OL,4,A'significant' issues with water supply
OL,5,Afor six years
OL,6,
OL,7,FInformation obtained by BBC Scotland
OL,8,FNews showed that in 2020/2021 the cold
OL,9,Fwater infrastructure was described as
OL,10,Fbeing in "very poor condition." Further
OL,11,Frecords show there have been several
OL,12,Fissues with the water between now and
OL,13,Fthen.
OL,15,FIn response, the SPS said that HMP
OL,16,FBarlinnie was a Victorian-era prison at
OL,17,F"risk of catastrophic failure" and in
OL,18,Fneed of replacement.
